  "shippingHtml": "<div class=\"not-prose\"><p>Delivery is 7–21 working days after the order and site requirements are confirmed. Delivery is free within Bangalore city and Delhi NCR. Freight for all other destinations is quoted separately in the written quotation.</p><p>A written quotation is returned within 48 hours.</p></div>",
